@startuml
title Goal agent: propose, validate, correct, approve
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
start
:Trigger: Goals page or CLI;
:Deterministic input boundary\nSurplus, cap, offered kinds, debts via privacy gateway;
if (Input error?) then (yes)
  :Output boundary: error; no new goals;
  stop
endif
if (No surplus, nothing offered, or insufficient cap?) then (yes)
  :Output boundary: no new goals\nSupersede old unanswered proposals;
  stop
endif
:LLM proposes 1 to 3 goals\nKind, order, monthly amount, rationale, strategy;
:Deterministic validation boundary\nCap, offered kinds, uniqueness, amounts, 600-month horizon;
if (Invalid?) then (yes)
  :Privacy feedback boundary\nOriginal facts + normalized rejected allocations\n+ code-generated failures;
  :LLM corrects proposal\nSecond and final call;
  :Deterministic validation boundary;
  if (Still invalid?) then (yes)
    :Output boundary: error; no new goals\nEarlier proposals remain;
    stop
  endif
endif
note right
  Model unreachable: error, no new goals.
  No hidden schema retry inside either call.
  Feedback excludes raw reply and rejected rationale.
end note
:Output boundary: atomically save new proposals\nSupersede older unanswered proposals;
note right: If accepted goals changed during planning: error, no new goals.
if (Checkpointer present?) then (yes)
  :Clear debts, plans, allocations, proposal and prompt;
  :interrupt: awaiting_user;
  :Human accepts or dismisses each goal;
  :Resume without LLM; wait until all resolved;
endif
:Output boundary: run complete;
stop
@enduml
